.env*.local

# The admin studio's recovery buffer (content/.trash) is deliberately NOT
# ignored. The hosted studio commits deletes through the GitHub API, and a
# trash that never leaves one browser tab would make "delete" irreversible on
# the next reload. Nothing reads it — the loaders and the validator take named
# content directories and .mdx files only — so it never reaches the site.

